---
import SiteCanvas from '../components/SiteCanvas'
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="de">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>PROTOTYPE — Scroll-gekoppelte 3D-Choreografie (Senify)</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <SiteCanvas client:only="react" />

    <main>
      <section data-section class="sec hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">Prototype · Senify · Ticket 20</p>
        <h1 data-reveal>Scroll<br />→ 3D</h1>
        <p class="sub" data-reveal>Ein Canvas. Ein Page-Script. Ein Store.</p>
        <span class="scroll-hint">↓ scrollen</span>
      </section>

      <section data-section class="sec">
        <h2 data-reveal>1 · Page-Script-Layer</h2>
        <p data-reveal>
          Lenis Smooth Scroll und GSAP ScrollTrigger laufen in <em>einem</em> rAF-Loop. Motion braucht
          keine React-Hydration — nur dieser eine Layer kennt den Scroll.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section data-section id="pin" class="sec pin">
        <h2 data-reveal>2 · Pinned Showcase</h2>
        <p data-reveal>
          Diese Sektion ist gepinnt. Ihr Fortschritt fließt live in den Store → Kamera und Objekt
          reagieren scrub-gekoppelt, ohne einzufrieren.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section data-section class="sec">
        <h2 data-reveal>3 · Shared Store</h2>
        <p data-reveal>
          Der window-gebundene Store überbrückt Page-Script und React-Island zuverlässig — auch wenn
          Astro beide getrennt bündelt. Das ist das Muster für die Section↔Scene-Bridge.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section data-section class="sec outro">
        <h2 data-reveal>Ende.</h2>
        <p data-reveal>Erkenntnisse wandern in Ticket 03 (Motion &amp; 3D) und Ticket 08 (Section-Library).</p>
      </section>
    </main>

    <script>
      import { initPageMotion } from '../scripts/page-motion'
      initPageMotion()
    </script>

    <style is:global>
      :root {
        color-scheme: dark;
      }
      * {
        margin: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      html,
      body {
        background: #07080c;
        color: #e8e6f0;
        font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      }
      body {
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }

      .canvas-wrap {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      .canvas-wrap canvas {
        display: block;
      }

      main {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      .sec {
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 1.4rem;
        padding: 12vh 8vw;
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }
      .eyebrow {
        letter-spacing: 0.25em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: #9aa0b4;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 7rem);
        line-height: 1.02;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }
      h2 {
        font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      }
      p {
        max-width: 46ch;
        color: #b9bed0;
        line-height: 1.65;
      }
      .scroll-hint {
        color: #7e8499;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
      }

      .hud {
        position: fixed;
        top: 1rem;
        right: 1rem;
        z-index: 10;
        font: 12px/1.5 ui-monospace, 'Cascadia Code', monospace;
        background: rgba(10, 12, 18, 0.72);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem;
        color: #cfd3e2;
        backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
        pointer-events: none;
        white-space: pre;
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        .scroll-hint {
          display: none;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
